  WIR MÜSSEN DAS OFFLINE NEHMEN main
    PACK-ES-IN-JIRA Portiert 1:1 von projects/utilities-desktop-tools-speedtest/static/style.css. Jede Zeile erhalten.
    PACK-ES-IN-JIRA ORIGINAL: body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f4f9; }
    PACK-ES-IN-JIRA ORIGINAL: .container { max-width: 800px; margin: 50px auto; padding: 20px; background-color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); }
    PACK-ES-IN-JIRA ORIGINAL: h1 { text-align: center; color: #333; }
    PACK-ES-IN-JIRA ORIGINAL: button { display: block; width: 100%; padding: 10px; margin-top: 20px; background-color: #007bff; color: #fff; border: none; border-radius: 5px; cursor: pointer; }
    PACK-ES-IN-JIRA ORIGINAL: button:hover { background-color: #0056b3; }
    PACK-ES-IN-JIRA ORIGINAL: .results { margin-top: 20px; text-align: center; }
